      "title": "🍽️ VIENNA’S NEW MEDITERRANEAN HOTSPOT – WITH AN OTTOLENGHI CONNECTION! 👀✨ Looking for one of Vienna’s coolest new restaurants? M",
      "brand": "Social Food Fund",
      "description": "🍽️ VIENNA’S NEW MEDITERRANEAN HOTSPOT – WITH AN OTTOLENGHI CONNECTION! 👀✨ Looking for one of Vienna’s coolest new restaurants? Meet BOCA Vienna, a stylish Mediterranean restaurant inside the boutique hotel The Companion, just steps from Westbahnhof! The kitchen is led by New Zealand-born chef Lauryn Therin, who previously worked with celebrity chef Yotam Ottolenghi in London! 👩‍🍳 Expect creative Mediterranean sharing plates inspired by Spain, France, Italy and the Levant – combining bold flavors, seasonal ingredients and a modern twist. And BOCA has already earned 1 Gault&Millau toque! 🏆 ✨ WHAT MAKES BOCA SPECIAL: 🍽️ Creative Mediterranean sharing plates 👩‍🍳 Former Ottolenghi chef Lauryn Therin 🐙 Aubergine “Octopus” – crispy eggplant with lemon yoghurt & mojo rojo 🥩 Slow-cooked beef short ribs with brown butter cauliflower purée 🥖 BOCA Pintxo with mussel escabeche & ajo blanco 🏆 1 Gault&Millau toque (12/20 points) 🪩 Stylish 1970s-inspired interior with historic Viennese details 🌿 Beautiful courtyard for outdoor dining 🍸 Calypso cocktail bar right next door 🥐 BONUS: SATURDAY BRUNCH CLUB! Every Saturday from 12–3 PM, BOCA serves an all-you-can-eat Mediterranean brunch buffet with unlimited hot beverages for €49 per person. 📍 BOCA – THE COMPANION VIENNA Mariahilfer Straße 127a, 1150 Vienna, Austria 💡 Reservations recommended. ➕ Follow us for Vienna’s coolest new restaurants, hidden gems & unforgettable experiences! #TasteAndTheCity #BocaVienna #ViennaRestaurants #ViennaFoodGuide #thingstodoinvienna",
